OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDense fog during the morning
OL,6,Fgiving poor visibilities, lingering in
OL,7,Fplaces. Turning cloudier during the
OL,8,Fafternoon with outbreaks of rain by
OL,9,Fthe evening. Feeling chilly with a
OL,10,Fbreeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA damp evening for most with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain. Rain continuing
OL,14,Fthroughout the night, becoming lighter
OL,15,Fand patchier by dawn. Breezy with
OL,16,Ftemperatures above freezing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
