OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with patchy
OL,6,Frain through the morning. Turning
OL,7,Fdrier through the morning, bringing
OL,8,Fsome glimmers of sunshine. Chilly with
OL,9,Fa frost overnight into Thursday.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith plenty of autumnal sunshine
OL,13,Fthroughout. Feeling colder, especially
OL,14,Fin the brisk northerly winds to start
OL,15,Fwith overnight frost. Hazy sunshine
OL,16,Ffor Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
